## FP-024 — accrues from day one, not usable before day 90 (§ 246(c))

```catala
#[test]
declaration scope TestFp024:
  output computation content S.SickLeaveAccrual

scope TestFp024:
  definition computation equals
    output of S.SickLeaveAccrual with {
      -- hours_worked: 600.0
      -- weeks_worked: 15
      -- work_state: T.WorkState.CA
      -- days_employed: 45
      -- exempt: false
    }
  assertion computation.accrual_divisor = 30.0
  assertion computation.accrued_hours = 20.0
  assertion computation.annual_use_cap = 40.0
