## FP-025 — exempt employee deemed to work 40 hours a week (§ 246(b)(2))

```catala
#[test]
declaration scope TestFp025:
  output computation content S.SickLeaveAccrual

scope TestFp025:
  definition computation equals
    output of S.SickLeaveAccrual with {
      -- hours_worked: 840.0
      -- weeks_worked: 21
      -- work_state: T.WorkState.CA
      -- days_employed: 200
      -- exempt: true
    }
  assertion computation.accrual_divisor = 30.0
  assertion computation.accrued_hours = 28.0
  assertion computation.annual_use_cap = 40.0
  assertion computation.usable = true
```

